 𝐒 𝐈 𝐀 𝐎💎", "comment_id": "18137674918596760", "comment_text": "個人常回訪或很喜歡的名單：\n勞瑞斯牛排\n八和燒肉\n潼鐵板燒(喜歡海鮮會很愛)\n橘色火鍋(每個月都想吃至少一次)\n如嬌雞湯火鍋(本人愛喝濃郁雞湯）\n三元花園韓式餐廳\n九記港式海鮮餐廳(都是大菜要整桌人)\n豚人拉麵(超濃厚湯頭）", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DbxIfKQE32f", "created_at": "2026-08-07 22:39:17", "error": null, "like_count": 7, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "18113719412301018", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841467427379287", "author_name": "廖嘉生", "comment_id": "17970392684934879", "comment_text": "英雄塚\n臉書：https://www.facebook.com/share/1MbjCME3AC/\n台北市 信義區 松隆路9巷32號1樓\n🚇捷運市府站4號出口，步行約6-8分鐘\n☎️ 02 2765 8933\n🈺 18:00–00:00\n周日、周一公休", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DbxITbUk_qh", "created_at": "2026-08-07 22:37:41", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "18113719412301018", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841476264732746", "author_name": "Sunny Su.", "comment_id": "18141923677484067", "comment_text": "我正在吃鳳城燒臘烤鴨便當，已經幾代烤鴨太柴了", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DbxHltdEi8M", "created_at": "2026-08-07 22:31:26", "error": null, "like_count": 2, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "18113719412301018", "reply_count": 0}], "end_cursor": "AQHTdEXpOiItP58HCTpL2NdD7GVT0VQgetHnT1UmgVZMt7vOfOSrvkOUCNK4yTgSSa5CEHSupEYl8QfM0YK-e1G3-w", "error": null, "has_next_page": true, "media_id": "18113719412301018", "total_count": 4301}], "retrieved_at": {"user_local": "2026-11-07T12:53:03.378+08:00", "user_timezone": "Asia/Taipei", "utc": "2026-11-07T04:53:03.378Z"}}